msgid "Search works for the translations stored on this computer (KJV and any bundled or imported Bible). Online translations can't be searched, because their owners don't allow it (ESV may offer its own online search)."
msgstr "Utafutaji unafanya kazi kwa tafsiri zilizohifadhiwa kwenye kompyuta hii (KJV na Biblia yoyote iliyojumuishwa au iliyoletwa). Tafsiri za mtandaoni haziwezi kutafutwa, kwa sababu wamiliki wake hawaruhusu (ESV inaweza kuwa na utafutaji wake wa mtandaoni)."

