msgid "Words match their beginnings: love finds love, loved, loveth, lovest, loving. Words shorter than 3 letters must match exactly."
msgstr "Maneno hulinganishwa kwa mwanzo wake: mwanga hupata mwanga, mwangaza, mwangavu. Maneno yenye herufi chini ya 3 lazima yalingane kamili."

