msgstr "Inapakua “{title}” — {left}"

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "Finishing “{title}”…"
msgstr "Inamalizia “{title}”…"

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "Adding “{title}” to the library…"
msgstr "Inaongeza “{title}” kwenye maktaba…"

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "Downloaded “{title}”"
msgstr "“{title}” imepakuliwa"

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "It's in Video & media and in the service."
msgstr "Iko katika Video na midia na kwenye ibada."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "It's in Video & media."
msgstr "Iko katika Video na midia."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "Saved at lower quality (360p) because the video joiner couldn't be set up."
msgstr "Imehifadhiwa kwa ubora wa chini (360p) kwa sababu kiunganishi cha video hakikuweza kuandaliwa."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "Can't reach YouTube. Check the internet connection and try again."
msgstr "Imeshindwa kufikia YouTube. Kagua muunganisho wa intaneti kisha ujaribu tena."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "This video is private, so only its owner can download it."
msgstr "Video hii ni ya faragha, kwa hiyo mmiliki wake pekee ndiye anaweza kuipakua."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "YouTube only shows this video to signed-in viewers (for example, it is age-restricted), so it can't be downloaded here."
msgstr "YouTube huonyesha video hii kwa watazamaji walioingia tu (kwa mfano, ina kizuizi cha umri), kwa hiyo haiwezi kupakuliwa hapa."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "This video is only for the channel's members, so it can't be downloaded here."
msgstr "Video hii ni ya wanachama wa chaneli pekee, kwa hiyo haiwezi kupakuliwa hapa."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "YouTube wants a sign-in to check this isn't a robot. Wait a while and try again."
msgstr "YouTube inataka uingie ili kuhakikisha kuwa wewe si roboti. Subiri kwa muda kisha ujaribu tena."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "This live stream hasn't finished yet. Try again after it ends."
msgstr "Mtiririko huu wa moja kwa moja bado haujaisha. Jaribu tena baada ya kuisha."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "This live stream or premiere hasn't started yet."
msgstr "Mtiririko huu wa moja kwa moja au onyesho la kwanza bado halijaanza."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "This live stream just ended and YouTube is still preparing it. Try again in a while."
msgstr "Mtiririko huu wa moja kwa moja umeisha sasa hivi na YouTube bado inauandaa. Jaribu tena baada ya muda."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "That link isn't a YouTube video. Copy the link from the video's page and try again."
msgstr "Kiungo hicho si video ya YouTube. Nakili kiungo kutoka ukurasa wa video kisha ujaribu tena."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "This video isn't available. It may have been removed, or blocked in this country."
msgstr "Video hii haipatikani. Huenda imeondolewa, au imezuiwa katika nchi hii."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "This playlist has no videos that can be downloaded."
msgstr "Orodha hii haina video zinazoweza kupakuliwa."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "The computer's disk is full. Free up some space and try again."
msgstr "Diski ya kompyuta imejaa. Futa vitu ili kupata nafasi kisha ujaribu tena."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "YouTube changed something and the downloader can't read this video yet. Try again later."
msgstr "YouTube imebadilisha kitu na kipakuaji bado hakiwezi kusoma video hii. Jaribu tena baadaye."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "Couldn't get YouTube downloads ready. Check the internet connection and try again."
msgstr "Imeshindwa kuandaa upakuaji wa YouTube. Kagua muunganisho wa intaneti kisha ujaribu tena."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "The YouTube downloader that arrived didn't match its official fingerprint, so it wasn't used. Try again later."
msgstr "Kipakuaji cha YouTube kilichofika hakikulingana na alama yake rasmi ya utambulisho, kwa hiyo hakikutumika. Jaribu tena baadaye."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "YouTube downloads don't work on this kind of computer yet."
msgstr "Upakuaji wa YouTube bado haufanyi kazi kwenye aina hii ya kompyuta."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "Couldn't get YouTube downloads ready ({detail}). Try again later."
msgstr "Imeshindwa kuandaa upakuaji wa YouTube ({detail}). Jaribu tena baadaye."

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "The download didn't work: {detail}"
msgstr "Upakuaji haukufanya kazi: {detail}"

#: src/strings/youtube.rs
msgid "Cancelled."
msgstr "Imeghairiwa."

